  "releaseNotes": "The interface has been rebuilt in the Fluent 2 design language, so the tool now looks like a modern model-driven app - light in XrmToolBox, dark in Power Platform ToolBox. This is a visual change only. Nothing about what the tool does has changed. Needs the System Administrator role.",
